'''Oosalon Mesa''' was a [[mesa]]<ref name="Oosalon Mesa">{{Databank|oosalon-mesa|Oosalon Mesa}}</ref> located on the [[planet]] [[Oosalon]],<ref name="Trivia Gallery">{{SW|url=series/star-wars-rebels/shroud-of-darkness-trivia-gallery|text="Shroud of Darkness" Trivia Gallery}} {{C|Slide 1}}</ref> a barren world<ref name="Oosalon Mesa" /> in [[the galaxy]]'s [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="Age of Republic">{{StoryCite|story=The Weapon|book=Age of Republic Special 1}}</ref> In [[3 BBY]],<ref name="Shroud of Darkness date">{{RebelsDate|218}}</ref> it was the site of a [[Duel on Oosalon|duel]] in which [[Kanan Jarrus]] and [[Ezra Bridger]] fought against the [[Fifth Brother]] and [[Seventh Sister]].<ref name="Shroud of Darkness" />

